      {
        "url": "https://www.century.edu/live/news/1103-century-college-recognized-as-a-2026-leader",
        "label": "3Mar Century College Recognized as a 2026 Leader College by Achieving the Dream Century College has been designated a 2026 Leader College by Achieving the Dream (ATD), a national nonprofit organization committed to advancing community colleges as accessible hubs of learning, credentialing, and economic mobility. Leader Colleges are recognized for meaningful progress in expanding access; improving early momentum metrics such as retention; advancing evidence-based student success strategies; and strengthening institutional capacity through intentional culture and systems change."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.century.edu/live/news/1096-century-college-raises-the-curtain-on-renovated",
        "label": "10Nov Century College Raises the Curtain on Renovated Performing and Visual Arts Center WHITE BEAR LAKE, Minn. — Century College celebrated the grand opening of its newly renovated Performing and Visual Arts Center on Friday, November 7, 2025, with an evening filled with creativity, connection, and community."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.century.edu/live/news/1094-century-college-celebrates-expansion-of-dental",
