      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.century.edu/live/news/1092-meet-century-college-alum-janel-swanson",
        "label": "18Sep Meet Century College Alum Janel Swanson Janel Swanson’s path to kitchen and bath design began with a spark—ignited during a home remodel that transformed more than just her living space. After years devoted to raising her children and teaching, she found herself captivated by the process of creating beautiful, functional environments. What started with selling cabinets on Craigslist quickly grew into a thriving business, driven by her eye for detail, love of learning, and a bold leap into entrepreneurship."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.century.edu/live/news/1091-meet-century-college-student-broden-lombard",
        "label": "16Sep Meet Century College Student Broden Lombard Broden Lombard has always been fueled by creativity. From building robots as a kid to performing in band, orchestra, and marching band, his passion for design and innovation has been a constant thread throughout his life. “If you didn’t learn something today, you didn’t try hard enough,” Broden says. “There’s so much to learn every day out there in the world.”"
